Your face melts, exploding in a targeted gush of blood and gore dealing [63, 84, 101, 116, 128 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage ([314, 422, 507, 578, 641 (TL1-5; SP 100)] total) in a cone over 5 turns.

Each turn the target will be dealt an additional [44, 59, 71, 81, 90 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage per disease.

Damage will increase with your Spellpower.
